                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great morning touring the Huntsman Cancer Institute. I was privileged to meet with their CEO and executive leadership team for an up close look at the work they are doing.\u00a0\n\nTwo- thirds of @huntsmancancer patients live in Utah. I am thankful for their dedication to lifesaving research and care. In just over 25 years, HCI has redefined the fight against cancer\u2014from understanding and prevention, to early detection, treatment, and improved survival rates.",
