                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Obamacare promised affordability, but premiums keep rising, fraud has exploded, and taxpayers pay the price while insurers cash in. \n\nInstead of pouring billions into a broken system, we should restore accountability, cap subsidies, and expand real solutions like HSAs, competition, and reforms that actually lower costs.\n\nAmericans deserve healthcare that\u2019s affordable because it is affordable, not because Washington hides the bill.",
